clusive proof but  it is a possibility it's clear to me  that the moon civilization will turn out  to be extremely important in the final  saga of the one piece story and i think  that the moon people will end up playing  a crucial role in the secret history of  the world i think it's possible that  this highly advanced civilization  actually invented the devil fruits and  this very power may be what allowed them  to move from the moon to the earth and  establish a great kingdom there but this  power may also have been the reason for  their downfall since by its very nature  devil fruit power is one that can easily  fall into the wrong hands the enemies of  the moon people which would probably be  rival kingdoms that originated on earth  may have stolen their devil fruits and  used them to destroy the ancient kingdom  and to erase it from history leaving  only a few scattered remnants behind  such as the residents of the sky islands  the technology on karakuri the  ponoglyphs and of course the devil  fruits themselves all will be revealed  when vegapunk finally shows up and if by  some chance it turns out that he has  wings on his back i will laugh harder  than roger laughed on laugh tale  let me know what your favorite devil  fruit origin theory is down in the  comments below and if you enjoyed this  video do me a quick favor and please  subscribe and hit that notification bell  for more one piece content thanks again  to marshall d preach for helping me out  definitely check out his channel link in  the description if you're looking for a  video to watch next check out my theory  that luffy has lunarian dna link in the  description as always thank you guys so  much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys

