hen nika  the possibilities are truly endless and  i'm sure that this is only the beginning  of nika's full potential since we still  have a few big arcs to go in the story  so going off of what and meg mentioned  earlier maybe a human named nika ate the  first devil fruit from a tree and this  gave him the powers of a god the power  to create anything he could imagine and  if we're going so far back in time the  world may have been less advanced and so  the imagination and creativity would  really be important to create these  powers the implication of this would be  that maybe luffy in the future could  possibly be able to create a new set of  devil fruits and something this  ridiculous fits right there with why the  golden state fear this power's very  existence going so far to erase it from  history another possibility could be  what if the devil fruits were created by  the d clan or more specifically the  ancient kingdom we know that there was  ancient technology in the past one  example of this are the ancient weapons  now what if on a much smaller scale the  ancient kingdom had an army of devil  fruit users and after meeting toki we  now know that devil fruits existed at  least 800 years ago during the voice  entry era in one piece people like nico  robbie and goldie roger are deemed  devils by the government and in robin's  case she researches the ancient kingdom  the ancient weapons and the true history  finding the pony glyphs roger was  similar but he was also the freest man  who directly opposed the government by  becoming the pirate king is it possible  that the world government or the  celestial dragons called the fruits  devil fruits because they came from  their previous enemies of the d-clan or  the advanced technology of the ancient  kingdom dr vegapunk is someone who is  tied deeply to devil for research he has  created unexplainable experiments like  funk freed he's replicated momonosuke's  devil fruit almost perfectly and he was  able to incorporate kizaru's light laser  beam into the pacifistas but what's most  interesting to me is how the mad science  group was once the top of all signs were  members like judge queen caesar and of  course vegapunk this group was shut down  for researching and conducting illegal  activities but eventually vegapunk would  end up working for the world government  and we know exactly what illegal  research means in one piece the world's  biggest taboos the pony clips and now  this science group could they all be  connected in some way but the funding  and the resources provided to vegapunk  after joining the government is  interesting to me that they allowed them  to continue these experiments as long as  they are for the world government and i  bring all of this up to say that just  like the elites at the top are  interested in the ancient weapons for  their own power like we saw in enos  lobby the government might have been  opposed to devil fruits but made  exceptions if the power was harnessed  for their own control vegapunk is known  to be centuries ahead of his time so if  there fruits did come from the ancient  kingdom his fascination with these  fruits could be all the more valuable  with see prism stone being tied to wano  i wonder if the reason why this nation  was so valuable in the past was because  they controlled the biggest weakness of  the d-clan or the ancient kingdom's  fruit weapons and finally the biggest  reason for me believing that devil  fruits may have been created by the  ancient kingdom besides the devil  labeling is due to the fact that it  seems like almost no information or  history is left of them there's overall  a very limited knowledge of them so i  think it's more than a fair question to  ask if these devil fruits are connected  to the ancient kingdom the d clan and  the void century we know that the  ancient kingdom was erased from history  so maybe along with the extinguished  light went the truth about devil fruits  and their origins  and now for my personal favorite theory  about the secret origins of the devil  fruits the theory that they came from  the moon or rather that they were  created by the advanced ancient  civilization that used to live on the  moon now i came up with this theory  during my own research but i'm sure that  i'm not the first one to ever talk about  it i just personally haven't seen it  discussed anywhere else it all starts  with an l's epic cover story that  features his journey to the moon the  cover page for chapter 470 features nl  and the four automata from earth  studying a mural or wall painting made  by the ancient winged people who used to  live on the moon in the upper right  corner of the image we see two moon  people working on one of the moon  automata and these moon automata look  almost exactly like the four earth  automata except for their outfits and  wings i will talk more about this  similarity a little bit later but if you  look just above the two people who are  working on this particular automaton you  will see a sphere with a swirly design  inside of it although this sphere may  just represent like a light or something  i couldn't help but think that this  swirly design looks a lot like the  swirly designs that are featured on so  many known devil fruits we also now know  that devil fruits have a will of their  own and clearly the automata that the  moon civilization created have their own  will as well so if this moon  civilization was able to imprint a form  of sentience into these inanimate  objects the automata then it isn't too  hard to believe that they may have also  been able to imprint a form of sentience  into the devil fruits themselves we know  that the moon people eventually flew  down to earth because they ran out of  resources on the moon we know they  stopped on the sky islands and  presumably they arrived there first  because that is closer to the moon than  the actual ground some members of the  moon civilization seemingly remained on  the sky islands and the skypeans are  their descendants the moon people also  made it down to the surface and they  created the ancient city of shandora at  least one 1  100 years ago we can also surmise that  some of the moon people made it to  karakuri island the birthplace of dr  vegapunk that is because in the modern  day a resident of karakuri island named  dr tsukimi was able to build four  automata that are remarkably similar to  the automata on the moon and not just in  terms of the technology used to create  them but even in terms of their basic  appearance the karakuri automata wear  different outfits but otherwise they  look and function just like the moon  automata and the similarities are simply  too blatant to be considered a  coincidence i believe that the residents  of karakuri island were directly exposed  to the advanced technology of the moon  civilization  probably because some of the members of  this civilization settled on karakuri  and that is why this island is home to  such incredible and futuristic  technology in the first place but the  automata are only the beginning  vegapunk is well known for his research  on devil fruits the seastone and the  lineage factor and his knowledge of  these important subjects is said to be  500 years ahead of current technology in  the world of one piece or rather the  current technology on earth vegapunk's  breakthroughs in devil fruit research  could actually be a direct result of the  moon civilization's presence on karakuri  island if i am correct that some moon  people visited karakuri or even settled  there and if the moon people really are  the ones who created the devil fruits in  the first place then this would not only  explain why karakuri island is so  technologically advanced it would also  explain why vegapunk's research on devil  fruits is so far ahead of its time it is  because vegapunk gained special insight  into the truth about devil fruits from  the very people who created them there  also appears to be an ancient connection  between the moon civilization and wano  which is significant because wano is  where the rare mineral known as sea  stone originates sea stone is a  substance that can drain a devil fruit  user's stamina and nullify their powers  when the devil fruit user comes into  direct contact with it so sea stone is  definitely an important aspect of the  wider devil fruit story we know that  seastone originates on wano and we know  that the kozuki clan from wano are the  creators of the ponoglyphs but did you  know that the cover page for chapter 472  a page which shows nl looking at the  wall murals on the moon also features  what looks a lot like ponoglyphs in the  upper right corner of the mural if you  compare this writing to the writing on  the poneglyphs you will notice many  similar elements including the little  dots the little triangles the little  symbols that look like upside down and  sideways l's and so on since this  writing on the moon dates back several  centuries before the void century it is  possible that this moon language was  actually the basis of the language used  to create the poneglyphs which if true  would connect the moon civilization  directly to wano the people from the  moon must have visited wano and the  kozuki clan's knowledge of the  ponoglyphs may have been the direct  result of their visit on top of that the  cover page for chapter 448 shows dr  tsukimi working on one of the automata  and if you look closely two katana are  seen hanging on the wall in the top left  corner if these are swords that  originate in wano itself then this  suggests a potential connection between  karakuri island and wano since wano has  been strictly closed off from the  outside world for many years getting a  katana from wano or gaining the  knowledge to produce a faithful replica  would not be easy without a direct  connection to wano itself now there are  katana in one piece in places other than  wano so this isn't conclusive proof but  it is a possibility it's clear to me  that the moon civilization will turn out  to be extremely important in the final  saga of the one piece story and i think  that the moon people will end up playing  a crucial role in the secret history of  the world i think it's possible that  this highly advanced civilization  actually invented the devil fruits and  this very power may be what allowed them  to move from the moon to the earth and  establish a great kingdom there but this  power may also have been the reason for  their downfall since by its very nature  devil fruit power is one that can easily  fall into the wrong hands the enemies of  the moon people which would probably be  rival kingdoms that originated on earth  may have stolen their devil fruits and  used them to destroy the ancient kingdom  and to erase it from history leaving  only a few scattered remnants behind  such as the residents of the sky islands  the technology on karakuri the  ponoglyphs and of course the devil  fruits themselves all will be revealed  when vegapunk finally shows up and if by  some chance it turns out that he has  wings on his back i will laugh harder  than roger laughed on laugh tale  let me know what your favorite devil  fruit origin theory is down in the  comments below and if you enjoyed this  video do me a quick favor and please  subscribe and hit that notification bell  for more one piece content thanks again  to marshall d preach for helping me out  definitely check out his channel link in  the description if you're looking for a  video to watch next check out my theory  that luffy has lunarian dna link in the  description as always thank you guys so  much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys
 

